@startuml architecture_physique
' Diagramme de déploiement — infrastructure réelle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #2C3E50
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FDF6E3
  BorderColor #B58900
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #EEF6FF
  BorderColor #2C6FBB
}
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50

title Architecture physique — cluster Kubernetes 3 nœuds

actor "Utilisateur\n(navigateur)" as U

cloud "Internet" as NET

node "Cluster Kubernetes (3 nœuds)" as CLUSTER {

  node "vm01 — control-plane" as VM1
  node "vm02 — worker" as VM2
  node "vm03 — worker" as VM3

  component "CNI Cilium\n(NetworkPolicy standard)" as CILIUM
  component "MetalLB\n(pool LoadBalancer L2)" as MLB
  component "Kourier\n(ns kourier-system — ingress Knative)" as KOURIER

  package "namespace: knative-serving" as NSKS {
    component "Controller / Autoscaler (KPA)" as KPA
    component "Activator" as ACT
  }

  package "namespace: knative-eventing" as NSKE {
    component "kafka-controller\n(KafkaSource)" as KSRC
    component "MT-Channel Broker\n(filtre les Triggers)" as BROKER
  }

  package "namespace: platform" as NSP {
    node "Deployment platform-api\n(Spring Boot 3 / Java 17)" as API
    node "Deployment platform-web\n(web-portal — nginx + React/Vite)" as WEBD
    node "Deployment platform-admin\n(admin-console — nginx + React/Vite)" as ADMD
    node "Keycloak\n(realm platform)" as KC
    database "PostgreSQL\npostgres.platform.svc:5432" as PG
    database "Elasticsearch\nelasticsearch.platform.svc:9200" as ES
  }

  package "namespace: kafka (Strimzi)" as NSK {
    node "Kafka Cluster\nmy-cluster-kafka-bootstrap.kafka.svc:9092" as KAFKA
    component "Strimzi Topic Operator\n(CR KafkaTopic)" as STO
  }

  package "namespace: monitoring" as NSM {
    node "Prometheus\n(ServiceMonitor + PodMonitor queue-proxy)" as PROM
    node "Alertmanager" as AM
    node "Grafana" as GRAF
  }

  package "namespaces tenants : user-<username>" as NST {
    node "Knative Service (app tenant)\n  Revision -> Pod\n  [queue-proxy | user-container]" as APPPOD
    component "Broker 'default'" as TBROKER
    component "KafkaSource + Trigger" as TCR
    component "NetworkPolicy\ntenant-default-isolation" as NP
  }

  node "Jenkins\n(agents Kaniko)" as JENKINS
}

cloud "Docker Hub\nindex.docker.io" as DHUB
cloud "Stripe API" as STRIPE

U     --> NET
NET   --> MLB   : HTTP/HTTPS
MLB   --> KOURIER
MLB   --> WEBD
KOURIER --> APPPOD : routage *.<domaine> tenant
WEBD  --> API   : /api (proxy)
ADMD  --> API
API   --> PG    : JDBC
API   --> ES
API   --> KC    : OIDC / Admin REST
API   --> KAFKA : AdminClient + Producer
API   --> PROM  : HTTP query
API   --> AM    : HTTP /api/v2/alerts
API   --> STRIPE : HTTPS
API   ..> CLUSTER : Fabric8 KubernetesClient\n(ServiceAccount + ClusterRole)
API   --> APPPOD : pods/log (user-container)
KPA   --> APPPOD : scale 0..N
ACT   --> APPPOD : réveil scale-from-zero
KSRC  --> KAFKA  : consume
KSRC  --> TBROKER : CloudEvent (sink)
TBROKER --> TCR
TCR   --> APPPOD : subscriber URI
STO   --> KAFKA
PROM  --> APPPOD : scrape queue-proxy
GRAF  --> PROM
CILIUM .. NP     : applique
JENKINS --> DHUB : build Kaniko + push
JENKINS --> NSP  : kubectl set image
DHUB  --> APPPOD : pull image applicative
VM1 .. CLUSTER
VM2 .. CLUSTER
VM3 .. CLUSTER

note right of DHUB
  Registre d'images = Docker Hub
  (auth "https://index.docker.io/v1/"
   dans Jenkinsfile.backend).
  Aucun Harbor dans le dépôt.
end note

' Classes utilisées : aucune (diagramme de déploiement)
' Contrôleurs utilisés : n/a
' Services utilisés : KnativeService, EventingService, MetricsService, AlertmanagerService, PaymentService, KeycloakAdminService (points d'intégration représentés par les flèches sortantes de platform-api)
' Pourquoi ces éléments apparaissent : chaque nœud/namespace correspond à un manifeste ou à une URL de service réellement présente dans le dépôt.
' Fichiers sources vérifiés :
'   ci-cd/jenkins/pipelines/Jenkinsfile.backend:82 (index.docker.io), :96 (kubectl set image)
'   k8s/backend/deployment.yaml:25 (postgres.platform.svc.cluster.local:5432)
'   k8s/backend/rbac.yaml:53-113 (ClusterRole serving/eventing/sources/kafka.strimzi.io/pods-log)
'   k8s/tenant/network-policy.yaml:18-65 (kourier-system, knative-serving, monitoring, kafka)
'   k8s/monitoring/service-monitor.yaml, k8s/monitoring/queue-proxy-podmonitor.yaml, k8s/monitoring/alertmanager-config.yaml
'   k8s/admin/deployment.yaml:2 (pool LoadBalancer MetalLB)
'   k8s/backup/elasticsearch-snapshot-cronjob.yaml:26 (elasticsearch.platform.svc:9200)
'   backend-api/src/main/resources/application-k8s.yml:36,44,47 (keycloak, kafka bootstrap Strimzi, prometheus)
'   backend-api/src/main/java/com/platform/api/app/KnativeWatcher.java:59 (namespaces "user-*")
' Divergences relevées :
'   - Harbor est absent du dépôt : le registre réel est Docker Hub.
'   - Cilium et MetalLB ne sont documentés que dans les fichiers d'audit/commentaires (AUDIT_PRODUCTION_READINESS.md:32, k8s/admin/deployment.yaml:2) ; aucune CRD Cilium ni IPAddressPool n'est versionnée dans k8s/.
@enduml
